{"case_id": 4077, "Source": "1st Serhii Kulchytskyi Battalion (Ukraine)", "Index": 0, "Text": "The 1st Operational Battalion named after the Hero of Ukraine Serhii Kulchytskyi is a volunteer battalion of the 1st Presidential Brigade, a part of the Offensive Guard of the National Guard of Ukraine. It is an all-volunteer battalion with its personnel being the former members of Maidan Defense and other paramilitary groups established by the Ukrainian opposition during the Revolution of Dignity. It was established in 2014 and is garrisoned at Novi Petrivtsi. It is a highly combat-effective formation and has seen heavy combat during both the War in Donbas and the full-scale war after the 2022 Russian invasion of Ukraine.", "entities": [{"entity": "1st Operational Battalion", "label": "ORG", "start": 4, "end": 29, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Hero of Ukraine", "label": "MISC", "start": 46, "end": 61, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Serhii Kulchytskyi", "label": "PER", "start": 62, "end": 80, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "1st Presidential Brigade", "label": "ORG", "start": 113, "end": 137, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Offensive Guard", "label": "ORG", "start": 153, "end": 168, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "National Guard of Ukraine", "label": "ORG", "start": 176, "end": 201, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Maidan Defense", "label": "ORG", "start": 283, "end": 297, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Ukrainian", "label": "MISC", "start": 347, "end": 356, "origin": "human_added_or_corrected"}, {"entity": "Revolution of Dignity", "label": "MISC", "start": 379, "end": 400, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "2014", "label": "DATE", "start": 424, "end": 428, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Novi Petrivtsi", "label": "LOC", "start": 450, "end": 464, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "