{"case_id": 1630, "Source": "Luhansk People's Republic", "Index": 51, "Text": "On 19 September 2022, the People's Councils in both the Luhansk People's Republic and the Donetsk People's Republic appealed to their respective heads of state to \"immediately\" conduct referendums on joining Russia. The next day, the LPR's People's Council scheduled a referendum on the republic's entry into Russia as a federal subject for 23–27 September. However, the referendum was not recognised by most members of the international community, citing the absence of international monitoring and concerns regarding its compliance with international law. Consequently, many states regarded the vote as invalid and inconsistent with Ukraine's territorial integrity.", "entities": [{"entity": "19 September 2022", "label": "DATE", "start": 3, "end": 20, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "People's Councils", "label": "ORG", "start": 26, "end": 43, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Luhansk People's Republic", "label": "LOC", "start": 56, "end": 81, "origin": "human_added_or_corrected"}, {"entity": "Donetsk People's Republic", "label": "LOC", "start": 90, "end": 115, "origin": "human_added_or_corrected"}, {"entity": "Russia", "label": "LOC", "start": 208, "end": 214, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "LPR's People's Council", "label": "ORG", "start": 234, "end": 256, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Russia", "label": "LOC", "start": 309, "end": 315, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "23–27 September", "label": "DATE", "start": 341, "end": 356, "origin": "human_added_or_corrected"}, {"entity": "Ukraine", "label": "LOC", "start": 635, "end": 642, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}], "entity_count": 9, "annotation_source": "full_paragraph_manual_review", "reviewed_at_utc": "2026-11-03T06:33:51.214503+00:00", "input_identity": "8c5e768a8c54b5c2cb3a33f357871fed75c4f2e056e36918105ee64acc580139", "rejected_flertdat