{"case_id": 2115, "Source": "Bridge over Saint Volodymyr Descent", "Index": 11, "Text": "When the bridge was under construction, Ukrainian Ministry of Culture sent a letter to Kyiv City State Administration to ask for canceling the project because of Volodymyr hills being an object of UNESCO Word Heritage. The administration refused to stop the construction stating that its location is outside of the Sofia Cathedral's buffer zone which makes it perfectly legal. In March 2019, Mayor of Kyiv Vitali Klitschko alongside director of Historical Heritage Olena Serdiuk had visited the UNESCO headquarters in Paris to present the project of Kyiv's tourist route and to prove the legality of the new bridge. UNESCO's consulting mission decided to visit Kyiv in April.", "entities": [{"entity": "Ukrainian Ministry of Culture", "label": "ORG", "start": 40, "end": 69, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Kyiv City State Administration", "label": "ORG", "start": 87, "end": 117, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Volodymyr hills", "label": "LOC", "start": 162, "end": 177, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "UNESCO Word Heritage", "label": "MISC", "start": 197, "end": 217, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Sofia Cathedral", "label": "LOC", "start": 315, "end": 330, "origin": "human_added_or_corrected"}, {"entity": "March 2019", "label": "DATE", "start": 380, "end": 390, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Kyiv", "label": "LOC", "start": 401, "end": 405, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Vitali Klitschko", "label": "PER", "start": 406, "end": 422, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Olena Serdiuk", "label": "PER", "start": 465, "end": 478, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "UNESCO", "label": "ORG", "start": 495, "end": 501, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Paris", "label": "LOC", "start": 518, "end": 523, "origin": "human_confirmed_flert