{"case_id": 2935, "Source": "Malaysia Airlines Flight 17", "Index": 130, "Text": "JIT responded that it had requested details about recovered missile parts from Russia in May 2018, but had received no answer. It said, information from the Russian Ministry of Defence would be carefully studied as soon as the documents were made available, as requested in May 2018 and required by UNSC in 2016. JIT stated it had always carefully analysed information provided by Russia, but information presented to the public was inaccurate on several points. Russia had given differing accounts over time of how MH17 was shot down; for example claiming to have evidence (radar images) that a Ukrainian fighter fired an air-to-air missile at MH17.", "entities": [{"entity": "JIT", "label": "ORG", "start": 0, "end": 3, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Russia", "label": "LOC", "start": 79, "end": 85, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "May 2018", "label": "DATE", "start": 89, "end": 97, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Russian Ministry of Defence", "label": "ORG", "start": 157, "end": 184, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "May 2018", "label": "DATE", "start": 274, "end": 282, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "UNSC", "label": "ORG", "start": 299, "end": 303, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "2016", "label": "DATE", "start": 307, "end": 311, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "JIT", "label": "ORG", "start": 313, "end": 316, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Russia", "label": "LOC", "start": 381, "end": 387, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Russia", "label": "LOC", "start": 463, "end": 469, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "MH17", "label": "MISC", "start": 516, "end": 520, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Ukrainian", "label": "MISC", "start": 596, "end": 605, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"e