{"case_id": 3178, "Source": "Russian armoured train Baikal", "Index": 3, "Text": "Amur and Baikal, was originally used for logistical exercises back in 2016, however, with the advent of the 2022 Russian invasion of Ukraine, Baikal performed a role similar to that of Yenisei, in which it was primarily used as a rear-line unit meant for technical reconnaissance, mine clearance, and the restoration of the railway track and small man-made constructions with minimal destruction. Although this has changed recently by December 2023, to a more active role in the front lines. Like Volga, Baikal also has a dedicated UAV drone team for scouting and reconnaissance purposes.", "entities": [{"entity": "Amur", "label": "MISC", "start": 0, "end": 4, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Baikal", "label": "MISC", "start": 9, "end": 15, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "2016", "label": "DATE", "start": 70, "end": 74, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "2022", "label": "DATE", "start": 108, "end": 112, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Russian invasion of Ukraine", "label": "MISC", "start": 113, "end": 140, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Baikal", "label": "MISC", "start": 142, "end": 148, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Yenisei", "label": "MISC", "start": 185, "end": 192, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "December 2023", "label": "DATE", "start": 435, "end": 448, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Volga", "label": "MISC", "start": 497, "end": 502, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Baikal", "label": "MISC", "start": 504, "end": 510, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}], "entity_count": 10, "annotation_source": "full_paragraph_manual_review", "reviewed_at_utc": "2026-11-03T06:52:34.046149+00:00", "input_identity": "8c5e768a8c54b5c2cb3a33f357871fed75c4f2e056e36918105ee64acc580139", "rejected_flertdate_predictions": [], "baselin