{"case_id": 2743, "Source": "Karelian Group", "Index": 2, "Text": "On 19 January 2023, most likely in reaction to the need for international volunteers, the Karelian Group was established by representatives associated with the Karelian National Movement—a nationalist movement advocating for Karelian independence since 2012, prior to the Revolution of Dignity, and Euromaidan. The announcement of the unit specified that it would be incorporated into the Ukrainian Armed Forces and operate within the framework of the International Legion. The stated purpose of the battalion, according to the several Karelian political activists involved in the establishment of the unit, was to engage in combat against the Russians in the Russian invasion of Ukraine. Additionally, they expressed the long-term goal of achieving the complete liberation and independence for the region of Karelia which they refer to as \"occupied Karelia\"—commonly known as the \"Republic of Karelia\". The Karelian Group also strives to promote the independence of other Finno-Ugric peoples from Russia.", "entities": [{"entity": "19 January 2023", "label": "DATE", "start": 3, "end": 18, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Karelian Group", "label": "ORG", "start": 90, "end": 104, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Karelian National Movement", "label": "ORG", "start": 160, "end": 186, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Karelian", "label": "MISC", "start": 225, "end": 233, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "2012", "label": "DATE", "start": 253, "end": 257, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Revolution of Dignity", "label": "MISC", "start": 272, "end": 293, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Euromaidan", "label": "MISC", "start": 299, "end": 309, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Ukrainian Armed Forces", "label": "ORG", "start": 389, "end": 411, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": 