{"case_id": 1716, "Source": "Vladimir Zhoga", "Index": 5, "Text": "At one point after the start of the 2022 Russian invasion of Ukraine, Zhoga challenged Ukrainian professional boxer Wladimir Klitschko to a duel after the latter announced that he had volunteered for the Ukrainian Army. Zhoga was killed on 5 March 2022 in combat with the Armed Forces of Ukraine during the Battle of Volnovakha in the 2022 invasion. A pro-Russian source said he died while trying to evacuate civilians. Pro-Ukrainian sources dismissed this claim as a lie spread by the DPR leadership. Journalist Nicholas Potter argued that the portrayal of Zhoga as a victim was \"cynical\", considering that the Sparta Battalion was the aggressor in the battle.", "entities": [{"entity": "2022 Russian invasion of Ukraine", "label": "MISC", "start": 36, "end": 68, "origin": "human_added_or_corrected"}, {"entity": "Zhoga", "label": "PER", "start": 70, "end": 75, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Ukrainian", "label": "MISC", "start": 87, "end": 96, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Wladimir Klitschko", "label": "PER", "start": 116, "end": 134, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Ukrainian Army", "label": "ORG", "start": 204, "end": 218, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Zhoga", "label": "PER", "start": 220, "end": 225, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "5 March 2022", "label": "DATE", "start": 240, "end": 252, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Armed Forces of Ukraine", "label": "ORG", "start": 272, "end": 295, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Battle of Volnovakha", "label": "MISC", "start": 307, "end": 327, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "2022", "label": "DATE", "start": 335, "end": 339, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "pro-Russian", "label": "MISC", "start": 352, "end": 363, "origin": "human_added_or_corrected"}, {"entity": "Pro-Ukrainian", "label":