{"case_id": 6274, "Source": "Russian landing ship Korolyov", "Index": 5, "Text": "In September 2018, Korolyov and her sister ships Minsk and Aleksandr Shabalin, in company with several Dyugon-class landing craft, carried out landing exercises at the Khmelevka training ground in Kaliningrad Oblast. She was involved in similar exercises in April 2019, and ones in partnership with minesweeping forces in September that year. In February 2020, Korolyov deployed into the Atlantic to conduct exercises with the corvette Stoikiy.  She carried out further exercises on her return to the Baltic in March, and in July was part of the naval parade in Saint Petersburg.   In March 2021, Korolyov and her sister ships  Minsk and Kaliningrad, and the corvette Boikiy entered the Atlantic.  Kaliningrad and Korolyov entered the Mediterranean Sea on 25 March, while Boikiy and Minsk returned to the Baltic Sea on 27 March.", "entities": [{"entity": "September 2018", "label": "DATE", "start": 3, "end": 17, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Korolyov", "label": "MISC", "start": 19, "end": 27, "origin": "human_added_or_corrected"}, {"entity": "Minsk", "label": "MISC", "start": 49, "end": 54, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Aleksandr Shabalin", "label": "MISC", "start": 59, "end": 77, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Dyugon-class", "label": "MISC", "start": 103, "end": 115, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Khmelevka", "label": "LOC", "start": 168, "end": 177, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Kaliningrad Oblast", "label": "LOC", "start": 197, "end": 215, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "April 2019", "label": "DATE", "start": 258, "end": 268, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "September", "label": "DATE", "start": 322, "end": 331, "origin": "human_added_or_corrected"}, {"entity": "February 2020", "label": "DATE", "start": 346, "end": 359, "origin": "human_confirmed_fler