{"case_id": 6493, "Source": "HESA Shahed 136", "Index": 40, "Text": "On 8 September 2024, Russian drones entered both Romanian and Latvian airspace. Romanian scrambled two F-16s to monitor the drone's progress. It landed \"in an uninhabited area\" near Periprava, according to the Romanian Ministry of Defence. The drone that entered Latvian airspace from Belarus crashed near Rezekne. This comes as the ISW noted increased success in Ukrainian electronic warfare against Russian drones that resulted in \"several Russian Shahed drones (that) recently failed to reach their intended targets for unknown reasons.\" Two Kh-58s failed to reach their targets. The ISW claimed that use of electronic warfare saved air defence resources. On 10 October 2024, a Neptune missile struck an ammunition depot in Oktyabrsky, Krasnodar. Ukrainian intelligence claimed to have destroyed over 400 Shahed UAVs. On 23 July 2025, Ekonomichna Pravda claimed 9 out of 10 Shahed drones shot down were due to interceptor drones.", "entities": [{"entity": "8 September 2024", "label": "DATE", "start": 3, "end": 19, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Russian", "label": "MISC", "start": 21, "end": 28, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Romanian", "label": "MISC", "start": 49, "end": 57, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Latvian", "label": "MISC", "start": 62, "end": 69, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Romanian", "label": "MISC", "start": 80, "end": 88, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "F-16s", "label": "MISC", "start": 103, "end": 108, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Periprava", "label": "LOC", "start": 182, "end": 191, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Romanian Ministry of Defence", "label": "ORG", "start": 210, "end": 238, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Latvian", "label": "MISC", "start": 263, "end": 270, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Bel