{"case_id": 5224, "Source": "Yurii Kerpatenko", "Index": 0, "Text": "Yurii Leonidovych Kerpatenko (Ukrainian: Юрій Леонідович Керпатенко; 9 September 1976 – 28 September 2022) was a Ukrainian conductor, orchestrator, and accordionist who was the principal conductor of the Mykola Kulish Music and Drama Theatre from 2004 until his death in 2022. He was also the principal conductor of the Gileya chamber orchestra of the Kherson Regional Philharmonic from 2000 until 2022. Kerpatenko declined to cooperate during the Russian occupation of Kherson Oblast and was killed by Russian soldiers in his home in September 2022.", "entities": [{"entity": "Yurii Leonidovych Kerpatenko", "label": "PER", "start": 0, "end": 28, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Ukrainian", "label": "MISC", "start": 30, "end": 39, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Юрій Леонідович Керпатенко", "label": "PER", "start": 41, "end": 67, "origin": "human_added_or_corrected"}, {"entity": "9 September 1976", "label": "DATE", "start": 69, "end": 85, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "28 September 2022", "label": "DATE", "start": 88, "end": 105, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Ukrainian", "label": "MISC", "start": 113, "end": 122, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Mykola Kulish Music and Drama Theatre", "label": "ORG", "start": 204, "end": 241, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "2004", "label": "DATE", "start": 247, "end": 251, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "2022", "label": "DATE", "start": 271, "end": 275, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Gileya chamber orchestra", "label": "ORG", "start": 320, "end": 344, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Kherson Regional Philharmonic", "label": "ORG", "start": 352, "end": 381, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "2000", "label": "DATE", "start": 387, "end": 391, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}