{"case_id": 1083, "Source": "Mejlis of the Crimean Tatar People", "Index": 4, "Text": "The current Mejlis was founded in 1991, to act as a representative body for the Crimean Tatars which could address grievances to the Ukrainian central government, the Crimean government, and international bodies. In its activities Mejlis is subordinated to Qurultai, guided by its decisions, current regulations, the Mejlis of the Crimean Tatar people statute, norms of international law and legislative acts of Ukraine not in contradiction with these standards. The main goal of the Mejlis is the liquidation of consequences of genocide conducted by the Soviet state in regard to the Crimean Tatars (Surgun of 1944), reinstatement of national and political rights of the Crimean Tatar people and realization of their rights the free national state self-determination on its national territory. The Mejlis of the Crimean Tatar people consists of 33 members including the Mejlis chairperson. The Mejlis initially used a building located in Simferopol.", "entities": [{"entity": "Mejlis", "label": "ORG", "start": 12, "end": 18, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "1991", "label": "DATE", "start": 34, "end": 38, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Crimean Tatars", "label": "MISC", "start": 80, "end": 94, "origin": "human_added_or_corrected"}, {"entity": "Ukrainian central government", "label": "ORG", "start": 133, "end": 161, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Mejlis", "label": "ORG", "start": 231, "end": 237, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Qurultai", "label": "ORG", "start": 257, "end": 265, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Mejlis of the Crimean Tatar people statute", "label": "ORG", "start": 317, "end": 359, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Ukraine", "label": "LOC", "start": 412, "end": 419, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Mejlis", "label": "ORG", "start": 484, "end": 490