{"case_id": 1869, "Source": "Battle of Kherson", "Index": 17, "Text": "A group of 30–40 civilians had gathered at the entrance to Kherson from the village of Bilozerka on the evening of 28 February, amid rumors on social media that Russian forces would be entering the city there. They were unarmed except for two policemen with assault rifles. The group felled trees on the roads the Russian forces were anticipated to use, to impede their movement and facilitate ambushes with Molotov cocktails. By 01:00 on 1 March, the group left the area.", "entities": [{"entity": "Kherson", "label": "LOC", "start": 59, "end": 66, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Bilozerka", "label": "LOC", "start": 87, "end": 96, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "28 February", "label": "DATE", "start": 115, "end": 126, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Russian", "label": "MISC", "start": 161, "end": 168, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Russian", "label": "MISC", "start": 314, "end": 321, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Molotov", "label": "MISC", "start": 408, "end": 415, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "1 March", "label": "DATE", "start": 439, "end": 446, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}], "entity_count": 7, "annotation_source": "full_paragraph_manual_review", "reviewed_at_utc": "2026-11-03T07:35:02.463257+00:00", "input_identity": "8c5e768a8c54b5c2cb3a33f357871fed75c4f2e056e36918105ee64acc580139", "rejected_flertdate_predictions": [], "baseline_predictions": [{"entity": "Kherson", "label": "LOC", "start": 59, "end": 66}, {"entity": "Bilozerka", "label": "LOC", "start": 87, "end": 96}, {"entity": "28 February", "label": "DATE", "start": 115, "end": 126}, {"entity": "Russian", "label": "MISC", "start": 161, "end": 168}, {"entity": "Russian", "label": "MISC", "start": 314, "end": 321}, {"entity": "Molotov", "label": "MISC", "start": 408, "end": 415}, {"entity": "1 March", "label": "D