{"case_id": 2791, "Source": "Huliaipole offensive", "Index": 4, "Text": "In early October, Russian assault units made further gains to the west with the capture of Verbove. Simultaneous assaults began to the north of Malynivka, where Russian forces were able to advance into eastern Poltavka. On 7 October, units of the Ukrainian 141st Mechanized Brigade launched a counterattack in eastern Dnipropetrovsk resulting in the recapture of Sosnivka and Sichneve. In northeastern Zaporizhzhia, Russian troops advanced into Novovasylivske and Novohryhorivka. The following week, Russian forces seized the village of Oleksiivka, located to the north of Verbove. A Russian push west of Verbove led to the capture of Pryvillia, thus reaching the Yanchur river. Meanwhile in Poltavka, Russian troops took full control of the village by 19 October. Geolocated footage indicated that Russian forces established a bridgehead across the Yanchur river with the seizure of Zlahoda (formerly Pershotravneve). ", "entities": [{"entity": "Russian", "label": "MISC", "start": 18, "end": 25, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Verbove", "label": "LOC", "start": 91, "end": 98, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Malynivka", "label": "LOC", "start": 144, "end": 153, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Russian", "label": "MISC", "start": 161, "end": 168, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Poltavka", "label": "LOC", "start": 210, "end": 218, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "7 October", "label": "DATE", "start": 223, "end": 232, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Ukrainian 141st Mechanized Brigade", "label": "ORG", "start": 247, "end": 281, "origin": "human_added_or_corrected"}, {"entity": "Dnipropetrovsk", "label": "LOC", "start": 318, "end": 332, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Sosnivka", "label": "LOC", "start": 363, "end": 371, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Sichne