{"case_id": 4331, "Source": "Chernobyl exclusion zone", "Index": 43, "Text": "The poaching of game, illegal logging, and metal salvage have been problems within the zone. Despite police control, intruders started infiltrating the perimeter to remove potentially contaminated materials, from televisions to toilet seats, especially in Pripyat, where the residents of about 30 high-rise apartment buildings had to leave all of their belongings behind. In 2007, the Ukrainian government adopted more severe criminal and administrative penalties for illegal activities in the alienation zone, as well as reinforced units assigned to these tasks. The population of Przewalski's horse, introduced to the Exclusion Zone in 1998, has reportedly fallen since 2005 due to poaching.", "entities": [{"entity": "Pripyat", "label": "LOC", "start": 256, "end": 263, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "2007", "label": "DATE", "start": 375, "end": 379, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Ukrainian government", "label": "ORG", "start": 385, "end": 405, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Exclusion Zone", "label": "LOC", "start": 620, "end": 634, "origin": "human_added_or_corrected"}, {"entity": "1998", "label": "DATE", "start": 638, "end": 642, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "2005", "label": "DATE", "start": 672, "end": 676, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}], "entity_count": 6, "annotation_source": "full_paragraph_manual_review", "reviewed_at_utc": "2026-11-03T08:06:48.767077+00:00", "input_identity": "8c5e768a8c54b5c2cb3a33f357871fed75c4f2e056e36918105ee64acc580139", "rejected_flertdate_predictions": [{"entity": "Przewalski", "label": "PER", "start": 582, "end": 592}, {"entity": "'s", "label": "ORG", "start": 592, "end": 594}], "baseline_predictions": [{"entity": "Pripyat", "label": "LOC", "start": 256, "end": 263}, {"entity": "2007", "label": "DATE", "start": 375, "end": 379}, {"entity": "Ukrainian government", "label": "