{"case_id": 1926, "Source": "425th Unmanned Systems Regiment (Ukraine)", "Index": 2, "Text": "In September 2022, it was fighting during the 2022 Kharkiv counteroffensive. It saw combat during the Battle of Bakhmut conducting drone flights, artillery reconnaissance and combat support for over half a year. On the third day of the deployment in Bakhmut, its positions were heavily struck by Russian forces causing damage to equipment. It worked alongside the 77th Airmobile Brigade, facing tank assaults for a week and were ultimately able to destroy the tank with artillery support. Later, it worked alongside the 3rd Assault Brigade, conducting counterattacks on Klishchiivka, protecting the flanks and destroyed several targets with artillery support, airstrikes and HIMARS. It also saw combat during the Battle of Kupiansk, conducting reconnaissance and other tasks as well as evacuation of trapped personnel.", "entities": [{"entity": "September 2022", "label": "DATE", "start": 3, "end": 17, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "2022 Kharkiv counteroffensive", "label": "MISC", "start": 46, "end": 75, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Battle of Bakhmut", "label": "MISC", "start": 102, "end": 119, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Bakhmut", "label": "LOC", "start": 250, "end": 257, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Russian", "label": "MISC", "start": 296, "end": 303, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "77th Airmobile Brigade", "label": "ORG", "start": 364, "end": 386, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "3rd Assault Brigade", "label": "ORG", "start": 520, "end": 539, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Klishchiivka", "label": "LOC", "start": 570, "end": 582, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "HIMARS", "label": "MISC", "start": 675, "end": 681, "origin": "human_added_or_corrected"}, {"entity": "Battle of Kupiansk", "label": "MISC", "start": 713, "en