{"case_id": 3378, "Source": "Siege of the Luhansk border base", "Index": 2, "Text": "On 2 June at 12:30 AM, 100 rebel fighters attacked the border guard base, but the guards of the State Border Guard Service of Ukraine exchanged fire and managed to repel the attack. However, the numbers of rebels increased to 400, and according to the border guards, the rebels then went to residential areas, and fired from the tops of nearby apartments. Militants used automatic weapons and RPGs against the border guards. A lone plane was detached to try to support the border guards who were battling the rebels. According to the border guards, some of the militants were foreign fighters from Russia.", "entities": [{"entity": "2 June at 12:30 AM", "label": "DATE", "start": 3, "end": 21, "origin": "human_added_or_corrected"}, {"entity": "State Border Guard Service of Ukraine", "label": "ORG", "start": 96, "end": 133, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Russia", "label": "LOC", "start": 598, "end": 604, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}], "entity_count": 3, "annotation_source": "full_paragraph_manual_review", "reviewed_at_utc": "2026-11-03T13:17:48.452202+00:00", "input_identity": "8c5e768a8c54b5c2cb3a33f357871fed75c4f2e056e36918105ee64acc580139", "rejected_flertdate_predictions": [{"entity": "2 June", "label": "DATE", "start": 3, "end": 9}], "baseline_predictions": [{"entity": "2 June", "label": "DATE", "start": 3, "end": 9}, {"entity": "State Border Guard Service of Ukraine", "label": "ORG", "start": 96, "end": 133}, {"entity": "Russia", "label": "LOC", "start": 598, "end": 604}], "history": [{"command": "del 1", "before": [{"entity": "2 June", "label": "DATE", "start": 3, "end": 9}, {"entity": "State Border Guard Service of Ukraine", "label": "ORG", "start": 96, "end": 133}, {"entity": "Russia", "label": "LOC", "start": 598, "end": 604}], "after": [{"entity": "State Border Guard Service of Ukraine", "label": "ORG", "start": 96, "end": 133}, {"entity": "Russia", "