{"case_id": 4269, "Source": "1st Guards Rocket Brigade", "Index": 2, "Text": "In July 1943, for showing courage in the battles against the Nazi invaders the brigade was ranged among the Guards. A year later, in July 1944, for the capture of Orsha, an important railway junction, 14th Guards Heavy Cannon Artillery Brigade was given the honorary name \"Orsha\". On February 19, 1945, by the Decree of the Supreme Soviet of the USSR, the brigade was awarded the Order of Kutuzov 2nd degree for the exemplary performance of combat missions. May 17, 1945 for its heroism during the capture of the fortress of Konigsberg the brigade was awarded the Order of Suvorov. ", "entities": [{"entity": "July 1943", "label": "DATE", "start": 3, "end": 12, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Nazi", "label": "MISC", "start": 61, "end": 65, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "July 1944", "label": "DATE", "start": 133, "end": 142, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Orsha", "label": "LOC", "start": 163, "end": 168, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "14th Guards Heavy Cannon Artillery Brigade", "label": "ORG", "start": 201, "end": 243, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Orsha", "label": "LOC", "start": 273, "end": 278, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "February 19, 1945", "label": "DATE", "start": 284, "end": 301, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Supreme Soviet of the USSR", "label": "ORG", "start": 324, "end": 350, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Order of Kutuzov", "label": "MISC", "start": 380, "end": 396, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "May 17, 1945", "label": "DATE", "start": 458, "end": 470, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Konigsberg", "label": "LOC", "start": 525, "end": 535, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Order of Suvorov", "label": "MISC", "start": 564, "end": 580, "origin": "human_confirme