{"case_id": 3119, "Source": "September 2024 Poltava strike", "Index": 2, "Text": "The Office of the Prosecutor General said that \"One of the buildings of the Institute of Communications, a hospital and nearby houses were partially destroyed\". Emergency services rescued 25 people, including 11 who were trapped under the rubble of the affected buildings. The Ukrainian defence ministry said that the interval between activation of air raid sirens and the arrival of the missiles was too short to allow people to safely reach bomb shelters. The ministry added that the attack occurred while classes were ongoing.", "entities": [{"entity": "Office of the Prosecutor General", "label": "ORG", "start": 4, "end": 36, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Institute of Communications", "label": "ORG", "start": 76, "end": 103, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Ukrainian defence ministry", "label": "ORG", "start": 277, "end": 303, "origin": "human_added_or_corrected"}], "entity_count": 3, "annotation_source": "full_paragraph_manual_review", "reviewed_at_utc": "2026-11-03T13:32:26.765737+00:00", "input_identity": "8c5e768a8c54b5c2cb3a33f357871fed75c4f2e056e36918105ee64acc580139", "rejected_flertdate_predictions": [{"entity": "Ukrainian", "label": "MISC", "start": 277, "end": 286}, {"entity": "defence ministry", "label": "ORG", "start": 287, "end": 303}], "baseline_predictions": [{"entity": "Office of the Prosecutor General", "label": "ORG", "start": 4, "end": 36}, {"entity": "Institute of Communications", "label": "ORG", "start": 76, "end": 103}, {"entity": "Ukrainian", "label": "MISC", "start": 277, "end": 286}, {"entity": "defence ministry", "label": "ORG", "start": 287, "end": 303}], "history": [{"command": "del 3,4", "before": [{"entity": "Office of the Prosecutor General", "label": "ORG", "start": 4, "end": 36}, {"entity": "Institute of Communications", "label": "ORG", "start": 76, "end": 103}, {"entity": "Ukrainian", "label": "MISC", "start": 27