{"case_id": 6465, "Source": "HESA Shahed 136", "Index": 12, "Text": "As of late September 2023, Russian forces have reportedly started packing warheads with tungsten ball shrapnel, similar to the M30A1 and M30A2 series of GMLRS warheads. According to Ukrainian officials the Russian modifications included \"new warheads (tungsten shrapnel), engines, batteries, servomotors and bodies\". As of October 2023, Russia had significantly hardened and upgraded the Geran-2 in several iterations, though the authors of an occasional paper in 2024 estimated this had increased the production cost from $30,000 to about $80,000. One such upgrade is for a scout Geran-2 to conduct an electromagnetic spectrum survey, transmitting back to assist in safer route planning for follow-on munitions.", "entities": [{"entity": "September 2023", "label": "DATE", "start": 11, "end": 25, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Russian", "label": "MISC", "start": 27, "end": 34, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "M30A1", "label": "MISC", "start": 127, "end": 132, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "M30A2", "label": "MISC", "start": 137, "end": 142, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "GMLRS", "label": "MISC", "start": 153, "end": 158, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Ukrainian", "label": "MISC", "start": 182, "end": 191, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Russian", "label": "MISC", "start": 206, "end": 213, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "October 2023", "label": "DATE", "start": 323, "end": 335, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Russia", "label": "LOC", "start": 337, "end": 343, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Geran-2", "label": "MISC", "start": 388, "end": 395, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "2024", "label": "DATE", "start": 464, "end": 468, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Geran-2", "label": "MISC", "start":