{"case_id": 1013, "Source": "26th Artillery Brigade (Ukraine)", "Index": 1, "Text": "After the second world war, and several redesignations, the 117th Guards Rifle Division became the 117th Guards Tank Training Division. After the collapse of the Soviet Union, the 117th Guards Tank Training Division was succeeded by the 62nd Mechanized Brigade, which, in turn, was created 26th Artillery Brigade (based on the Directive of the Ministry of Defense of Ukraine from 18.06.2004 № 312/1/014).", "entities": [{"entity": "second world war", "label": "MISC", "start": 10, "end": 26, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "117th Guards Rifle Division", "label": "ORG", "start": 60, "end": 87, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "117th Guards Tank Training Division", "label": "ORG", "start": 99, "end": 134, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Soviet Union", "label": "LOC", "start": 162, "end": 174, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "117th Guards Tank Training Division", "label": "ORG", "start": 180, "end": 215, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "62nd Mechanized Brigade", "label": "ORG", "start": 237, "end": 260, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "26th Artillery Brigade", "label": "ORG", "start": 290, "end": 312, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Ministry of Defense of Ukraine", "label": "ORG", "start": 344, "end": 374, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "18.06.2004", "label": "DATE", "start": 380, "end": 390, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}], "entity_count": 9, "annotation_source": "full_paragraph_manual_review", "reviewed_at_utc": "2026-11-03T13:48:26.079521+00:00", "input_identity": "8c5e768a8c54b5c2cb3a33f357871fed75c4f2e056e36918105ee64acc580139", "rejected_flertdate_predictions": [], "baseline_predictions": [{"entity": "second world war", "label": "MISC", "start": 10, "end": 26}, {"entity": "117th Guards Rifle Division", "label": "ORG", "start"