{"case_id": 4238, "Source": "Soloti military training ground shooting", "Index": 3, "Text": "The Russian media website ASTRA reported that the shooters were Muslim Tajik nationals, and that they had gotten into an argument with other soldiers whether the war in Ukraine was \"holy\" (the Tajiks' position being that the only just war would be one waged by Muslims against infidels). They began the shooting after a lieutenant colonel allegedly described Allah as a \"weakling\" and \"coward.\" A \"source close to the investigation committee\" told RBK that the perpetrators were born in 1998 and 1999. The father of one of the alleged shooters confirmed to RFE/RL that his son had died during the weekend the shooting happened. The shooter's brother told RFE/RL that his sibling was an \"ordinary migrant\" who immigrated to Moscow from Southern Tajikistan several months before. The Tajikistan Ministry of Foreign Affairs said they were investigating reports that their citizens were involved in the attack.", "entities": [{"entity": "Russian", "label": "MISC", "start": 4, "end": 11, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "ASTRA", "label": "ORG", "start": 26, "end": 31, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Muslim", "label": "MISC", "start": 64, "end": 70, "origin": "human_added_or_corrected"}, {"entity": "Tajik", "label": "MISC", "start": 71, "end": 76, "origin": "human_added_or_corrected"}, {"entity": "war in Ukraine", "label": "MISC", "start": 162, "end": 176, "origin": "human_added_or_corrected"}, {"entity": "Tajiks", "label": "MISC", "start": 193, "end": 199, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Muslims", "label": "MISC", "start": 261, "end": 268, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Allah", "label": "PER", "start": 359, "end": 364, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "RBK", "label": "ORG", "start": 448, "end": 451, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "1998", "label": "DATE", "start": 487, 