{"case_id": 2945, "Source": "9th Army Corps (Ukraine)", "Index": 1, "Text": "The corps was formed on November 19, 2022, and was first mentioned in the order of Ministry of Defense of Ukraine on November 21, 2022. It was formed as part of a start to help reform the Ukrainian military under combined arms units, which would not take a greater force until early 2025. It was formed in the city of Lutsk in Volyn Oblast, based on the money allocation and visual representation of Lyubart’s Castle in the unit’s emblem. It was reportedly created in preparation for the summer 2023 Ukrainian offensive in southern Ukraine.", "entities": [{"entity": "November 19, 2022", "label": "DATE", "start": 24, "end": 41, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Ministry of Defense of Ukraine", "label": "ORG", "start": 83, "end": 113, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "November 21, 2022", "label": "DATE", "start": 117, "end": 134, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Ukrainian", "label": "MISC", "start": 188, "end": 197, "origin": "human_added_or_corrected"}, {"entity": "early 2025", "label": "DATE", "start": 277, "end": 287, "origin": "human_added_or_corrected"}, {"entity": "Lutsk", "label": "LOC", "start": 318, "end": 323, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Volyn Oblast", "label": "LOC", "start": 327, "end": 339, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Lyubart’s Castle", "label": "LOC", "start": 400, "end": 416, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "summer 2023 Ukrainian offensive", "label": "MISC", "start": 488, "end": 519, "origin": "human_added_or_corrected"}, {"entity": "Ukraine", "label": "LOC", "start": 532, "end": 539, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}], "entity_count": 10, "annotation_source": "full_paragraph_manual_review", "reviewed_at_utc": "2026-11-03T13:56:30.925298+00:00", "input_identity": "8c5e768a8c54b5c2cb3a33f357871fed75c4f2e056e36918105ee64acc580139", "rejected_flertdate_predictio