{"case_id": 3144, "Source": "Velyka Novosilka offensive", "Index": 11, "Text": "A second Russian assault towards Novyi Komar occurred in mid December, where elements of the 40th Naval Infantry Brigade managed to entrench themselves in the southern part of the village. In the south, Russian forces continued advances along the river bank, pressuring the village of Makarivka from three sides. Due to near encirclement, the Ukrainian group was forced to retreat northwards. The Russian Defence Ministry announced that their forces took full control over Novyi Komar by 19 December, which was corroborated by a Ukrainian military observer, who confirmed the claim and further reported that Russian forces had also reoccupied Rozdolne.", "entities": [{"entity": "Russian", "label": "MISC", "start": 9, "end": 16, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Novyi Komar", "label": "LOC", "start": 33, "end": 44, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "mid December", "label": "DATE", "start": 57, "end": 69, "origin": "human_added_or_corrected"}, {"entity": "40th Naval Infantry Brigade", "label": "ORG", "start": 93, "end": 120, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Russian", "label": "MISC", "start": 203, "end": 210, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Makarivka", "label": "LOC", "start": 285, "end": 294, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Ukrainian", "label": "MISC", "start": 343, "end": 352, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Russian Defence Ministry", "label": "ORG", "start": 397, "end": 421, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Novyi Komar", "label": "LOC", "start": 473, "end": 484, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "19 December", "label": "DATE", "start": 488, "end": 499, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Ukrainian", "label": "MISC", "start": 529, "end": 538, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Russian", "label": "MISC", "start": 608