{"case_id": 989, "Source": "Dyagilevo air base", "Index": 11, "Text": "On 5 December 2022, the base was attacked by Ukrainian drones which damaged a Tu-22M3 bomber and destroyed a fuel truck; three personnel were killed and five injured. The Engels Air Force Base was also raided on the same night. On 14 December, a Shahed-136 drone that exploded in a Kyiv apartment building had “For Ryazan“ written on it in Russian.", "entities": [{"entity": "5 December 2022", "label": "DATE", "start": 3, "end": 18, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Ukrainian", "label": "MISC", "start": 45, "end": 54, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Tu-22M3", "label": "MISC", "start": 78, "end": 85, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Engels Air Force Base", "label": "LOC", "start": 171, "end": 192, "origin": "human_added_or_corrected"}, {"entity": "14 December", "label": "DATE", "start": 231, "end": 242, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Shahed-136", "label": "MISC", "start": 246, "end": 256, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Kyiv", "label": "LOC", "start": 282, "end": 286, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Ryazan", "label": "LOC", "start": 315, "end": 321, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Russian", "label": "MISC", "start": 340, "end": 347, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}], "entity_count": 9, "annotation_source": "full_paragraph_manual_review", "reviewed_at_utc": "2026-11-03T14:02:10.977266+00:00", "input_identity": "8c5e768a8c54b5c2cb3a33f357871fed75c4f2e056e36918105ee64acc580139", "rejected_flertdate_predictions": [{"entity": "Engels Air Force Base", "label": "ORG", "start": 171, "end": 192}], "baseline_predictions": [{"entity": "5 December 2022", "label": "DATE", "start": 3, "end": 18}, {"entity": "Ukrainian", "label": "MISC", "start": 45, "end": 54}, {"entity": "Tu-22M3", "label": "MISC", "start": 78, "end": 85}, {"entity": "Engels Air Force Base", "label": "ORG