{"case_id": 5272, "Source": "Great Construction", "Index": 6, "Text": "In 2022, investigative journalists reported that Budinvest Engineering, a company co-owned by Reznichenko’s close friend, received billion-hryvnia contracts for road repairs under the program. Following these reports, the National Anti-Corruption Bureau of Ukraine (NABU) conducted searches of Holyk’s properties in connection with suspicions of corruption schemes. Investigators also discovered text messages on Holyk’s phone with a contractor who had received over 4 billion UAH in state contracts. These messages revealed coordination of actions between Holyk and the contractor, including discussions about obtaining subsidies and the progress of construction work.", "entities": [{"entity": "2022", "label": "DATE", "start": 3, "end": 7, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Budinvest Engineering", "label": "ORG", "start": 49, "end": 70, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Reznichenko", "label": "PER", "start": 94, "end": 105, "origin": "human_added_or_corrected"}, {"entity": "National Anti-Corruption Bureau of Ukraine", "label": "ORG", "start": 222, "end": 264, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "NABU", "label": "ORG", "start": 266, "end": 270, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Holyk", "label": "PER", "start": 294, "end": 299, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Holyk", "label": "PER", "start": 413, "end": 418, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Holyk", "label": "PER", "start": 557, "end": 562, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}], "entity_count": 8, "annotation_source": "full_paragraph_manual_review", "reviewed_at_utc": "2026-11-03T14:16:52.455615+00:00", "input_identity": "8c5e768a8c54b5c2cb3a33f357871fed75c4f2e056e36918105ee64acc580139", "rejected_flertdate_predictions": [], "baseline_predictions": [{"entity": "2022", "label": "DATE", "start": 3, "end": 7}, {"entity": "Budinvest Engineering", "label