{"case_id": 1766, "Source": "Vladimir Putin speech on invading Ukraine", "Index": 7, "Text": "Further expansion of the NATO infrastructure and the beginning of military development in Ukraine's territories are unacceptable for us. The problem, of course, is not NATO itself – it is only an instrument of US foreign policy. The problem is that in the territories adjacent to us – territories that were historically ours, I emphasise – an 'anti-Russia' hostile to us is being created, placed under full external control; [it] is intensively settled by the armed forces of NATO countries and is supplied with the most modern weapons.", "entities": [{"entity": "NATO", "label": "ORG", "start": 25, "end": 29, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Ukraine", "label": "LOC", "start": 90, "end": 97, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "NATO", "label": "ORG", "start": 168, "end": 172, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "US", "label": "LOC", "start": 210, "end": 212, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "anti-Russia", "label": "MISC", "start": 344, "end": 355, "origin": "human_added_or_corrected"}, {"entity": "NATO", "label": "ORG", "start": 476, "end": 480, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}], "entity_count": 6, "annotation_source": "full_paragraph_manual_review", "reviewed_at_utc": "2026-11-03T14:27:06.459572+00:00", "input_identity": "8c5e768a8c54b5c2cb3a33f357871fed75c4f2e056e36918105ee64acc580139", "rejected_flertdate_predictions": [], "baseline_predictions": [{"entity": "NATO", "label": "ORG", "start": 25, "end": 29}, {"entity": "Ukraine", "label": "LOC", "start": 90, "end": 97}, {"entity": "NATO", "label": "ORG", "start": 168, "end": 172}, {"entity": "US", "label": "LOC", "start": 210, "end": 212}, {"entity": "NATO", "label": "ORG", "start": 476, "end": 480}], "history": [{"command": "add MISC | anti-Russia | 1", "before": [{"entity": "NATO", "label": "ORG", "start": 25, "end": 29}, {"entity": "Ukraine", "label": "LO