{"case_id": 998, "Source": "Battle of Popasna", "Index": 4, "Text": "On 21 April, Ukraine's 24th Mechanized Brigade, one of the main units defending the sector, claimed to have killed what appeared to be a 25-man unit of pro-Russian foreign mercenaries in overnight clashes in and around Popasna. Oleksiy Danilov, head of Ukraine's National Security Council, said Libyan and Syrian identification documents were purportedly recovered from the bodies of the unit. The 24th Mechanized Brigade said it had successfully repelled their assault and suggested the militants were foreign fighters of private military company Wagner Group and Russian citizens of rural origins. Danilov said Popasna remained under full Ukrainian control; however, the chairman of the Luhansk Regional Administration, Serhiy Haidai, said heavy fighting continued for the city.", "entities": [{"entity": "21 April", "label": "DATE", "start": 3, "end": 11, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Ukraine", "label": "LOC", "start": 13, "end": 20, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "24th Mechanized Brigade", "label": "ORG", "start": 23, "end": 46, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "pro-Russian", "label": "MISC", "start": 152, "end": 163, "origin": "human_added_or_corrected"}, {"entity": "Popasna", "label": "LOC", "start": 219, "end": 226, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Oleksiy Danilov", "label": "PER", "start": 228, "end": 243, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Ukraine", "label": "LOC", "start": 253, "end": 260, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "National Security Council", "label": "ORG", "start": 263, "end": 288, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Libyan", "label": "MISC", "start": 295, "end": 301, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Syrian", "label": "MISC", "start": 306, "end": 312, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "24th Mechanized Brigade", "label": "ORG", 