{"case_id": 5781, "Source": "Battle of Avdiivka (2017)", "Index": 3, "Text": "Until March 2016, the \"Industrial Zone\" (located in the eastern part of Avdiivka) was a buffer zone between the Donetsk People's Republic-controlled territories and the Ukrainian army. In March 2016, the Ukrainian army set up its fortifications in the \"Industrial Zone.\" This meant that the pro-Russian separatists no longer had full control of the highway that united their controlled cities of Donetsk and Horlivka and that it became more difficult for them to fire at Avdiivka with weapons not prohibited by the Minsk II agreement. Since March 2016 fighting for Avdiivka's \"Industrial Zone\" greatly intensified.", "entities": [{"entity": "March 2016", "label": "DATE", "start": 6, "end": 16, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Industrial Zone", "label": "LOC", "start": 23, "end": 38, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Avdiivka", "label": "LOC", "start": 72, "end": 80, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Donetsk People's Republic", "label": "LOC", "start": 112, "end": 137, "origin": "human_added_or_corrected"}, {"entity": "Ukrainian", "label": "MISC", "start": 169, "end": 178, "origin": "human_added_or_corrected"}, {"entity": "March 2016", "label": "DATE", "start": 188, "end": 198, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Ukrainian", "label": "MISC", "start": 204, "end": 213, "origin": "human_added_or_corrected"}, {"entity": "Industrial Zone", "label": "LOC", "start": 253, "end": 268, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "pro-Russian", "label": "MISC", "start": 291, "end": 302, "origin": "human_added_or_corrected"}, {"entity": "Donetsk", "label": "LOC", "start": 396, "end": 403, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Horlivka", "label": "LOC", "start": 408, "end": 416, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Avdiivka", "label": "LOC", "start": 471, "end": 479, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertd