{"case_id": 2507, "Source": "Oleksiy Zhuravko", "Index": 0, "Text": "Oleksiy Valeriyovych Zhuravko (Ukrainian: Олексій Валерійович Журавко, Russian: Алексей Валерьевич Журавко, romanized: Aleksey Valeryevich Zhuravko; 21 April 1974 – 25 September 2022) was a Ukrainian and Russian politician who was a member of Ukraine's national parliament Verkhovna Rada from 2006 to 2012. He was a member of the pro-Russian Party of Regions from 2006. Zhuravko moved to Russia in 2015. He acquired Russian citizenship and joined the United Russia party in July 2022. He died in September 2022 in a missile attack in Kherson during the Ukrainian southern counteroffensive.", "entities": [{"entity": "Oleksiy Valeriyovych Zhuravko", "label": "PER", "start": 0, "end": 29, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Ukrainian", "label": "MISC", "start": 31, "end": 40, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Олексій Валерійович Журавко", "label": "PER", "start": 42, "end": 69, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Russian", "label": "MISC", "start": 71, "end": 78, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Алексей Валерьевич Журавко", "label": "PER", "start": 80, "end": 106, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Aleksey Valeryevich Zhuravko", "label": "PER", "start": 119, "end": 147, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "21 April 1974", "label": "DATE", "start": 149, "end": 162, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "25 September 2022", "label": "DATE", "start": 165, "end": 182, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Ukrainian", "label": "MISC", "start": 190, "end": 199, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Russian", "label": "MISC", "start": 204, "end": 211, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Ukraine", "label": "LOC", "start": 243, "end": 250, "origin": "human_confirmed_flertdate"}, {"entity": "Verkhovna Rada", "label": "ORG", "start": 273, "end": 287, "origin": "hu